-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
14. BEST PRACTICES
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Log in first, then navigate through `/app.html` whenever possible.
- Start configuration in this order for a new tenant:
  1) Business Setup (profile, warehouses, spaces, assets, certifications).
  2) Employees & Roles.
  3) HR & Payroll profiles.
  4) Safety Audits and Safety Training.
  5) Accounting (Banks, Petty Cash, Payables/Receivables).
  6) Support, Billing, and Reports.
- Use screenshot placeholders in this document as a guide:
  - Run the app in your browser.
  - Take screenshots (PrintScreen or Snipping Tool).
  - In Word, right-click the placeholder line → Insert Picture → From File.

End of manual.
